# Avora: bookmark-feature test suites.
#
# Avora disables bookmarks browser-wide via
# browser_defaults::bookmarks_enabled = false (chrome/browser/defaults.cc).
# The suites below exist to test that feature -- the bookmark bar, the
# bookmark bubble and editor, the star, the bookmark menu delegate.  With the
# feature off they have nothing to exercise.
#
# These are excluded rather than rewritten on purpose.  Editing ~40 upstream
# tests to assert "disabled" would delete upstream's coverage and create a
# merge conflict in every one of them on each Chromium roll; excluding them
# leaves the files untouched, so a roll applies cleanly and the suites come
# back for free if bookmarks are ever re-enabled.
#
# Tests broken by the same flag but NOT about bookmarks are fixed in place
# instead -- see BrowserViewTest (fullscreen), ToolbarViewTest (focus cycling)
# and BrowserCommandControllerBrowserTest.BookmarkCommandsAreDisabled, which
# now guards the kill switch itself.
#
# Usage:
#   browser_tests --test-launcher-filter-file=\
#       ../../testing/buildbot/filters/avora.bookmarks.filter

-BookmarkAccountStorageMoveDialogInteractiveTest.*
-BookmarkAccountStorageMoveDialogPixelTest.*
-BookmarkBarDragAndDropInteractiveTest.*
-BookmarkBarNavigationTest.*
-BookmarkBarSimplifiedIPHInteractiveTest.*
-BookmarkBarTest.*
-BookmarkBrowsertest.*
-BookmarkBubbleViewInteractiveTest.*
-BookmarkBubbleViewIPHInteractiveTest.*
-BookmarkBubbleViewMigrationBrowserTest.*
-BookmarkBubbleViewShoppingCollectionBrowserTest.*
-BookmarkBubbleViewWithAccountBookmarksBrowserTest.*
-BookmarkEditorViewBrowserTest.*
-BookmarkEditorViewBrowserTestMoveDialog.*
-BookmarkEditorViewBrowserTestWithAccountBookmarks.*
-BookmarkMenuDelegateTest.*
-BookmarkPrerenderBrowsertest.*
-PowerBookmarkBubbleViewBrowserTest.*
-PrerenderBookmarkBarDisabledNavigationTest.*
-PrerenderBookmarkBarOnPressedNavigationTest.*
-PriceTrackingViewFeatureFlagBrowserTest.*
-SingleBookmarkUploadDialogPixelTest.*
